{
  "uid": "immich-homelab",
  "title": "Immich",
  "tags": ["homelab", "immich"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API metrics endpoint",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"immich-api\"}", "refId": "A" }],
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "down", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "up", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Microservices metrics endpoint",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"immich-microservices\"}", "refId": "A" }],
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "down", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "up", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Users",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "immich_users_total", "refId": "A", "instant": true }],
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jobs running now",
      "description": "Sum of every immich_queues_*_active gauge on the microservices worker.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum({__name__=~\"immich_queues_.+_active\", job=\"immich-microservices\"})", "refId": "A", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }, { "color": "blue", "value": 1 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Job failures (24h)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"immich_jobs_.+_failed_total\", immich_job!=\"\"}[24h])) or vector(0)", "refId": "A", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10 }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Asset rows created (24h)",
      "description": "Calls to AssetRepository.create - a proxy for new uploads, not an exact upload count.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(increase(immich_asset_repository_create_duration_count[24h])) or vector(0)", "refId": "A", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Job queues",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Active jobs by queue",
      "description": "One immich_queues_<queue>_active gauge per queue; the queue name is pulled out of the metric name.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "label_replace({__name__=~\"immich_queues_.+_active\", job=\"immich-microservices\"}, \"queue\", \"$1\", \"__name__\", \"immich_queues_(.+)_active\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true, "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Jobs completed per minute",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (immich_job) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_jobs_.+_success_total\", immich_job!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Job failures per minute",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (immich_job) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_jobs_.+_failed_total\", immich_job!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 20, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Jobs skipped per minute",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (immich_job) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_jobs_.+_skipped_total\", immich_job!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Machine learning p95",
      "description": "Both workers combined - the API worker does encode_text (search), microservices does detect_faces / encode_image / ocr.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (immich_op, le) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_machine_learning_repository_.+_duration_bucket\", immich_op!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_op}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Media pipeline p95 (top 8 operations)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(8, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (immich_op, le) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_media_repository_.+_duration_bucket\", job=\"immich-microservices\", immich_op!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_op}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API p95 by repository (top 10)",
      "description": "Slowest repositories on the API worker, across every method they expose.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (immich_repo, le) (rate({__name__=~\"immich_.+_repository_.+_duration_bucket\", job=\"immich-api\", immich_repo!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{immich_repo}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Worker runtime",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Worker memory",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_memory_usage{job=~\"immich-(api|microservices)\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Worker CPU",
      "description": "process_cpu_utilization summed over its user and system states, as a fraction of one core.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 41 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (job) (process_cpu_utilization{job=~\"immich-(api|microservices)\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": true }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "showLegend": true, "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About these metrics",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Names came from browsing `http://immich-server:8081/metrics` and `:8082/metrics` on Immich v3.1.0 with `IMMICH_TELEMETRY_INCLUDE=all`. Everything is exported by `nestjs-otel`; durations are **milliseconds**, and every timing metric is named `immich_<repo>_repository_<op>_duration`.\n\nThe job, repository and operation names live in the metric name rather than in labels, and `rate()` drops `__name__` - which also makes dozens of these metrics collapse onto one identical labelset, so a bare `rate({__name__=~\"...\"})` fails outright with *vector cannot contain metrics with the same labelset*. `monitoring/prometheus/prometheus.yml` fixes both problems by lifting the name parts into the `immich_job`, `immich_repo` and `immich_op` labels via `metric_relabel_configs`.\n\nThe `immich_op!=\"\"` / `immich_repo!=\"\"` / `immich_job!=\"\"` matchers on those panels are load-bearing - **don't remove them**. They exclude samples scraped before that relabel config was loaded, which have no such label and would bring the duplicate-labelset error back for any time range reaching into them. The trade-off is that those panels show nothing for time ranges predating the config, rather than erroring.\n\nDisk usage isn't exported by Immich - see the System and Postgres dashboards for that."
      }
    }
  ]
}
